#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:7
msgid "Projects tabs bar"
msgstr "项目标签栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:9
msgid ""
"The different opened projects from QElectroTech can be managed using PopUp "
"windows under the `menu bar`_ and `toolbars`_ or using a project tabs bar."
msgstr ""
"来自QElectroTech的不同打开的项目可以在 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 和 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ "
"下使用PopUp窗口进行管理，或者使用项目标签栏。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project tabs bar"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目标签栏"

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select **Display > Display projects > Using windows** menu item to manage "
"the projects by windows."
msgstr "选择 **Display > 显示项目 > 使用窗口** 菜单项来通过窗口管理项目。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:19
msgid ""
"Select **Display > Display projects > Using tabs** menu item to manage the "
"projects by tabs bar."
msgstr "选择 **Display > 显示项目 > 使用标签** 菜单项通过标签栏管理项目。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:21
msgid "The project tabs bar allows the following actions:"
msgstr "项目标签栏允许以下动作："

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:23
msgid "Choosing the active project by simple click on the tab."
msgstr "通过简单的点击标签选择活动项目 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/project_tabs.rst:24
msgid ""
"Closing the project by using the close tab which can be found at the right "
"side from each project tab."
msgstr "关闭项目，使用每个项目标签右侧的关闭标签 。"
